Root cause found: Lean constructs `/proc/<getpid()>/exe`, but this container exposes a different PID namespace through `/proc`, so that path returns `ENOENT`; `/proc/self/exe` remains valid. I’m testing a narrowly scoped preload shim that only redirects that failed executable-path lookup, leaving the pinned Lean/Klean project untouched.
